OL,3,GNEWSAHow yesterday's waste is becoming
OL,4,Atomorrow's fashion
OL,5,
OL,6,FHow many clothes, items of bedding and
OL,7,Fother fabric have you thrown away this
OL,8,Fyear?
OL,10,FWhile resale sites are growing in
OL,11,Fpopularity, in the UK we still bin
OL,12,Fabout 711,000 tonnes of textiles
OL,13,Fannually ` roughly the weight of seven
OL,14,FUS aircraft carriers.
OL,16,FThe global fashion and textiles
OL,17,Findustry is one of the most wasteful,
OL,18,Fbut recycling firms in Peterborough and
OL,19,FNorthamptonshire are using technology
OL,20,Fto change that.
